# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# SMARTCRYPTO AI v3.1.0 - ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION TEMPLATE (.env)
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your actual credentials.
# NEVER commit the real .env file to GitHub or version control!

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. APPLICATION & SECURITY
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ENVIRONMENT=production
APP_NAME=SmartCrypto
APP_VERSION=3.1.0
DEBUG=False
API_PREFIX=/api/v1

# Master secret key for JWT access tokens (Generate with: openssl rand -hex 32)
JWT_SECRET_KEY=your_super_secret_jwt_key_here_change_in_production
JWT_ALGORITHM=HS256
ACCESS_TOKEN_EXPIRE_DAYS=30
SERVER_IP=138.197.181.202

# API Documentation (Swagger / ReDoc / OpenAPI) Security
ENABLE_API_DOCS=True
DOCS_AUTH_ENABLED=True
DOCS_USERNAME=admin
DOCS_PASSWORD=choose_a_strong_docs_password_here

# High-performance caching & rate limiting
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379/0
CACHE_TTL_SECONDS=10
RATE_LIMIT_PER_MINUTE=120
RATE_LIMIT_AUTH_PER_MINUTE=10

# SnailGuard AI WAF Security
SNAILGUARD_ENABLED=True
SNAILGUARD_ECONOMIC_WARFARE=True
SNAILGUARD_API_KEY=SG-ENT-pL0oK9iJ8uH7yG6tF5rD4eS3wQ2aZ1xV

# Default Trading Profile (scalper, day_trader, swing, position)
TRADING_PROFILE=day_trader

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. EXCHANGE TRADING & CREDENTIALS
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Real Trading Master Switch: True enables live order execution, False runs paper trading
ENABLE_REAL_TRADING=False

# Global Testnet/Sandbox Mode (True = Testnet sandbox, False = Mainnet real money)
USE_TESTNET=True

# Binance Futures (USD-M Futures)
ENABLE_BINANCE=True
BINANCE_API_KEY=your_binance_api_key_here
BINANCE_API_SECRET=your_binance_api_secret_here
# Optional Binance testnet override (True/False)
# BINANCE_USE_TESTNET=True

# Bybit Futures (USDT Linear Futures)
ENABLE_BYBIT=True
BYBIT_API_KEY=your_bybit_api_key_here
BYBIT_API_SECRET=your_bybit_api_secret_here
# Optional Bybit testnet override (True/False)
# BYBIT_USE_TESTNET=True

# Optional HTTP/SOCKS proxy for geo-restricted regions (e.g. socks5://127.0.0.1:1080 or http://proxy:8080)
# EXCHANGE_PROXY_URL=

# Default Trading Parameters
DEFAULT_LEVERAGE=3
MARGIN_TYPE=ISOLATED

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. SUBSCRIPTION PAYMENT DESTINATION WALLETS (WHERE USER MONEY GOES)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Put your personal crypto wallet deposit addresses below:
WALLET_TRC20_ADDRESS=TYDzsYUb4r8ZJ3pA4rXvWzR8G9cK8v1a2b
WALLET_BSC_ADDRESS=0x742d35Cc6634C0532925a3b844Bc454e4438f44e
WALLET_POLYGON_ADDRESS=0x742d35Cc6634C0532925a3b844Bc454e4438f44e
WALLET_ERC20_ADDRESS=0x742d35Cc6634C0532925a3b844Bc454e4438f44e

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. TELEGRAM ALERTS & BROADCASTING
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ENABLE_TELEGRAM=False
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
TELEGRAM_CHANNEL_ID=
TELEGRAM_ADMIN_CHAT_ID=

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 5. TRADING / CAPITAL SETTINGS
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
TRADING_PROFILE=test
INITIAL_CAPITAL=10000.0
MAX_POSITION_SIZE=0.15
MIN_EXPECTED_RETURN_THRESHOLD=0.005
CONFIDENCE_THRESHOLD=0.50
MIN_CONFIDENCE=0.40
MIN_SIGNAL_STRENGTH=0.40
ATR_MULTIPLIER_SL=1.5
ATR_MULTIPLIER_TP=2.5
MAX_HOLDING_HOURS=72

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 6. TANZANIAN PAYMENT ON-RAMP & LIVE CURRENCY APIS (BEEM AFRICA & LIVE RATES)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Beem Africa API Credentials (Mobile Money: M-Pesa, Tigo Pesa, Airtel Money, HaloPesa)
BEEM_API_KEY=
BEEM_SECRET_KEY=
BEEM_LIVE_MODE=False
BEEM_CHECKOUT_URL=https://checkout.beem.africa/v1/checkout

# Dynamic Live Market Rate APIs (No hardcoding)
BINANCE_P2P_RATE_API_URL=https://p2p.binance.com/bapi/c2c/v2/friendly/c2c/adv/search
EXCHANGE_RATE_API_URL=https://open.er-api.com/v6/latest/USD
COINGECKO_RATE_API_URL=https://api.coingecko.com/api/v3/simple/price?ids=tether&vs_currencies=tzs
DEFAULT_TZS_PER_USDT=2640.0
RATE_CACHE_TTL_SECONDS=60

